Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Move restrictive SQL files to optional

- class_trainers.sql (removes spells from trainers, raises level reqs)
- mounts_and_riding.sql (vanilla riding levels 40/60, mount quests)
- player_starting_gear.sql (vanilla starting equipment)
- player_starting_skillbars.sql (vanilla starting skills)
- player_starting_weapon_skills.sql (vanilla starting weapon skills)

Zeppelin philosophy: keep content restoration, make restrictions optional.
